				v_u_3.Text = "Excellent!  Here are some other types of variables. Line 1 you have seen. Line 2 is a string variable (holds text in quotes). Line 3 uses .. to connect two strings. Line 4 makes a new object variable for SpawnLocation. Line 5 and 6 set some properties of SpawnLocation. Play it..."
