						v_u_3.Text = "Loops are a good way to repeat a group of lines. Notice on line 2 I inserted \'for j=1,8 do\'.  That means the lines between the \'do\' and the \'end\' will be repeated 8 times. A new variable j starts at 1 and is increased by 1 each time it loops until it has completed the 8th loop.  Play it..."
