						v_u_3.Text = "This loop repeats forever (until the game stops). This time we will adjust Position and Color properties repeatedly. Note: This picks random RGB (Red,Green,Blue) color numbers.  But you can choose specific color numbers using the color square in the Properties panel. Press Play..."
